== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: cmpnlexadd [ENC: VEX, MAP: 0F38, OPC: 0xEF]
     LENGTH:  6
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 64
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: VEX
    ISA-SET: CMPCCXADD
    ISA-EXT: CMPCCXADD
 EXCEPTIONS: AVX14
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_SIB HAS_VEX CPUFLAG_ACCESS ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: C4 82 C9 EF 14 08 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0     MEMORY    EXPLICIT      RW      MODRM_RM     64      1      64      UINT  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                  r8
                                                                                 INDEX =                  r9
                                                                                 SCALE =                   1
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000000
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT      RW     MODRM_REG     64      1      64      UINT                          rdx
 2   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R        NDSNDD     64      1      64      UINT                          rsi
 3   REGISTER      HIDDEN       W          NONE     64     64       1       INT                       rflags
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [    FLAGS ] ============================================================================================
    ACTIONS: [CF  : M  ] [PF  : M  ] [AF  : M  ] [ZF  : M  ] [SF  : M  ] [OF  : M  ] 
       READ: 0x00000000
    WRITTEN: 0x000008D5

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 128
  BROADCAST: NONE

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: cmpnlexadd %rsi, %rdx, (%r8,%r9,1)
   RELATIVE: cmpnlexadd %rsi, %rdx, (%r8,%r9,1)

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: cmpnlexadd qword ptr ds:[r8+r9*1], rdx, rsi
   RELATIVE: cmpnlexadd qword ptr ds:[r8+r9*1], rdx, rsi

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
C4 82 C9 EF 14 08 
:        :  :  :..SIB
:        :  :..MODRM
:        :..OPCODE
:..VEX
